   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "(For Lord Herluga to show such leniency@toward an <Anex> native...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "...Are Sieg and Sally aboard the Hagane?",
