   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "Iradoya",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "That's the ship the two of them surrendered to,@but whether they're still there is anyone's guess.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "Letting them make contact with the Hagane@wasn't just Vort's blunder, but yours as well.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "Ooh, you're gonna say that? Isn't that meeean?@Sure, Kinaha slipped up at the end,@but you've got no right to complain to us, you know?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "Both the one who proposed that operation@and the ones who betrayed us are Anex natives.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "You're all Gadisword people, aren't you?@Besides, Anex or <Rattma> or whatever,@none of that means anything anymore, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "(This woman...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "And the two deserters don't know about that, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "...It is.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "Then maybe hardly anything leaked beyond@what they learned when the Hiryu Custom@came to <Rabulpaila>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "That doesn't mean we can leave them be.@They'll be eliminated, along with Fairy Kribia.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "Well, still, I'd like you to make recovering@the Siebe Drive your top priority.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "I know.@Vort Nikolaus, if I judge that you're@of two minds, I'll shoot without warning.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "...Fine.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "Just to be clear...@if you do anything that hurts our interests,@we'll rethink how we deal with Gadisword, okay?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "I'll keep that in mind.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "By the way, that new model they brought in...@The Gyanonia, was it? First time I've seen it for real,@but it looks pretty tough. Is that for Bilgo?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "...No.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "Oh my, is that so. Well, good luck with your work.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "I'll go after the Hagane.@Bilgo, you draw off the Hiryu Custom.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "...Fine.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "(Tch... Why did Lord Herluga give Vort@command of this operation, and the@Gyanonia Ogre too...?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "(If it were Lady Reggiane, she'd... No,@given how she treats me, if anything...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "(Looks like Bilgo's flames of jealousy@are burning bright... wouldn't you say?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
