  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "Tetsuya",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "Everyone knows the drill by now,@and we're hunting Lamaris at full strength.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Azuki",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "Commander, urgent report from the Joint Chiefs!@Skull Knight and Crystal Dragoon have appeared@in Sao Paulo! They're capturing Lamaris!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "What!?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "Then next is Sao Paulo...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "Spatial distortion detected overhead!@It closely matches the sign of Debudedabide's halo!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "The spatial distortion overhead is intensifying!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "If Skull Knight and Crystal Dragoon@are in Sao Paulo, then the one coming out@is Debudedabide...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "Debudedabide, showing up now of all times!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "Debudedabide",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "I was eating, so I got here laaate",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "Eating?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "What does that guy even eat...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Don't tell me... Lamaris...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "Don't be stupiiid! I'm a gourmeeet!@I only eat crunchy Ganga rock!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "What the heck is that?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "OK, Gourmet Fatman.@I get it loud and clear... you love rocks.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "Aschen",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "His taste is set in stone, so to speak. Oh, hush.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "But with the pests gone,@maybe this works out even betterrr",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "Hm? Hardly any units have sortied.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "Because many units were in the middle of@field repairs and ammo resupply.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "That's not the best answer.@Can't you send out others? Anyone?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "(I can hardly say two Leonysis...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "It can't be helped.@Captain, this ship and the Hiryu Custom will stay@in position and support the mobile units.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "Roger.@To all mobile units. Debudedabide's objective@is believed to be collecting Kaana types.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "Wipe out the Lamaris before they start fusing.",
