   "en": "Gravity quake reading directly above the ship!@ES Wave Pattern is <Zovorg>!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "Now, will their presence turn out good or bad...?@Either way, a free-for-all suits me fine.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "Confirmed units believed to be the same models@as the Cupid and Leonysis! No data on the other type!",
