   "en": "Then until the Commander gives orders, this ship@will maintain TD Hovering here. All mobile units...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "Eun",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "New gravity quake reading directly above the ship!@ES Wave Pattern is <Zovorg>!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "Bufu! To think you'd come to me this sooon!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "I flew all the way here to punch your lights out,@fatso!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "If you join hands with the Golaikunru,@you'll end up making an enemy of the Zovorg!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "You're hardly united yourselves!@I believe in Lord Herluga's foresight!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "You seem sure that the Steel Dragons@have what you're after...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "(This may be a diversion, but if I get the chance,@I'd like to recover Ariard myself...!)",
