   "en": "You bastard, attacking at the worst possible time!@Thanks to you, Debudedabide got away!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "However it turned out, my timing for the attack@wasn't wrong.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
